symbols.declared_docstring:
Moving-block bootstrap of the signal-weighted mean excess over every trading day of the segment (days without
a signal carry k = 0). Blocks of `block` consecutive trading days are drawn and joined to the segment's length;
each draw's mean = sum(e * k) / sum(k); draws without a signal are dropped. Returns the share of means <= 0.

Two confirmed 5-bar local lows (centered window, only read for centers >= 2 bars old), 10-40 bars apart,
both inside the last 60 bars, within 3% of each other; neckline = max H from first to second low (inclusive);
C > 1.01*neckline; V > 1.3*VMA20(prior). Evaluated on tradable rows with the volume condition only.
